module vectors
edition 0
needs console


a Vector has a x (a number) and a y (a number)


to add u (a Vector) v (a Vector) giving a Vector:
    give back Vector with x (u's x plus v's x) and y (u's y plus v's y)


to main, needs console:
    let v be Vector with x 1 and y 2
    let w be Vector with x 3 and y 4
    show (v plus w)
    show (1 plus 2)
